id: EXT5-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_append_only
target: crates/core/src/ops_record.rs
find:         self.ops.push(HistoryOp::Reload);
replace:         self.ops.insert(0, HistoryOp::Reload);
expect-fail: property_append_only_with_reload_fixed
expect-fail: property_append_only_with_reload_guided
expect-fail: property_append_only_across_boot_fixed
note: 再読み込みの記録を末尾でなく先頭へ差し込み、既存の位置をずらす（性質 2）
